 629:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * @param  usic Pointer to USIC module handler of type @ref XMC_USIC_t.\n
 630:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * 				\b Range: @ref XMC_USIC0 to @ref XMC_USIC2 based on device support.
 631:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * @return None
 632:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  *
 633:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * \par<b>Description</b><br>
 634:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Enables the USIC module.\n\n
 635:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Enables the clock for the USIC module by following the
 636:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * clock enabling sequence for the selected device.
 637:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  *
 638:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * \par<b>Related APIs:</b><BR>
